# Implementation Plan - Standardize Lorcana Set Logo Icons

The objective is to fix the "Fabled" set image error by standardizing the Lorcana set logos to use high-quality thematic icons instead of potentially broken thumbnail images.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Lorcana sets will now use a **✨ Magic Sparkles (`fa-sparkles`)** icon as their primary logo.
> - This ensures no further image errors occur in this category.
> - **Pokémon and Magic: The Gathering will remain untouched.**

## Proposed Changes

### [Storefront Views]

#### [MODIFY] [lorcana_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/lorcana_index.php)
- Replace the `img` tag in `.set-logo-box` with a thematic `i` tag (`fa-sparkles`).
- Standardize the CSS for the Lorcana set icons.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- I will check the visual layout for Pokémon, Magic, and Lorcana category index pages.
